# Release & Post-Deploy Gates

## Before merge
Required for critical changes:
- requirement traceability;
- tests;
- security review;
- tenant isolation tests;
- migration safety;
- observability;
- rollback plan;
- updated runbook/ADR.

## Before production
- CI green;
- dependency/security checks;
- backup/recovery verification;
- control-plane migration reviewed;
- tenant migration plan reviewed;
- canary tenant plan;
- tenant DB connectivity tested;
- recording server health tested;
- provider sandbox/E2E checks;
- readiness/liveness checks;
- alerting confirmed;
- rollback verified.

## Deployment sequence
1. deploy backward-compatible code;
2. migrate control plane;
3. migrate canary tenant DBs;
4. run smoke tests;
5. roll tenant migrations in bounded batches;
6. enable feature flag;
7. verify telemetry;
8. expand rollout;
9. contract/remove obsolete schema only after stability.

## Post-deploy
Validate:
- authentication;
- tenant DB routing;
- one agency/customer workflow;
- one production-like call;
- recording artifact authorization;
- payment/webhook processing;
- queues;
- no cross-tenant access;
- error/latency/saturation.

A deployment is not complete until post-deploy verification passes.
